-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">✓</span>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;\">Cumplimiento ambiental sin sobrecostos</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;flex:1 1 260px;max-width:340px;\">\n          <span style=\"background:#00aeef;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;width:26px;height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">✓</span>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;\">Mejora del bienestar animal → mayor ganancia productiva</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;flex:1 1 260px;max-width:340px;\">\n          <span style=\"background:#00aeef;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;width:26px;height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">✓</span>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;\">Soluciones 100% colombianas fabricadas en Barranquilla</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;flex:1 1 260px;max-width:340px;\">\n          <span style=\"background:#00aeef;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;width:26px;height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">✓</span>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;\">Reducción de DQO, DBO y grasas y aceites en efluentes</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00aeef 0%,#1e6fa8 100%);padding:52px 24px;text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;\">\n      <h2 style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 10px;\">¿Necesitas cotización para tu granja?</h2>\n      <p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 28px;\">Nuestro equi